---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Glitched Network terms of service.">
    <main class="legal-page">
        <article>
            <h1 class="font-PressStart2P">Terms of Service</h1>
            <p>By playing on Glitched SMP, using this website, or joining our community spaces, you agree to follow the rules and use common sense.</p>

            <h2>Using The Server</h2>
            <p>Staff can remove, mute, ban, or limit anyone who breaks rules, causes problems, abuses bugs, or makes the server worse for other players.</p>

            <h2>Your Stuff</h2>
            <p>You are responsible for what you say, build, trade, post, or upload. Do not use the server for illegal content, hate, threats, malware, spam, or anything meant to damage the community.</p>

            <h2>Purchases, Perks, And Rewards</h2>
            <p>If the server offers paid perks, donations, events, giveaways, or rewards, they do not let you ignore the rules. Perks can change if balance, bugs, or server health require it.</p>

            <h2>Downtime And Changes</h2>
            <p>The server may restart, reset, update, break, or go offline. We try to protect player progress, but we cannot promise the server will always be online or that nothing will ever be lost.</p>

            <h2>Rule Changes</h2>
            <p>These terms can change when the server changes. If you keep using Glitched SMP after updates are posted, you accept the newer version.</p>
        </article>
    </main>
</MainLayout>
